  "quests": [
    {
      "id": "3AAD5C7715C13490",
      "title": "A Calling in the Ashes",
      "description": [
        "On your first server join, Ashen Oath opens a picker in chat for Mage, Warrior, Rogue or Ranger. Choose your starter identity and basic equipment. Returning players keep their class through death and relogging.",
        "Open Passive Skill Trees with O (default key) and select a class tree. The Ashen Oath starter picker and the modÃ¢â‚¬â„¢s skill tree classes are separate systems.",
        "Follow the branches: Mage northwest, Ranger northeast, Warrior southwest, Rogue southeast. Each region has two specializations. Mixing regions is allowed.",
        "Earn skill points through XP and spend them in the selected tree. Skills survive death.",
        "Craft a Memory of Renewal in JEI. Right-click to reset Passive Skill Tree allocations and reopen the class picker. Pick a new class or the same class for a fresh build. A second starter kit is never granted.",
        "These tutorials are optional and never block the five story chapters."
      ],
      "optional": true,
      "x": 0.0,
      "y": 0.0,
      "hide_until_deps_complete": false,
      "hide_until_deps_visible": false,
      "dependencies": [],
